  "voiceover": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.63,
      "text": "400+ iOS animations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.63,
      "end": 5.48,
      "text": "to help you find the exact smooth effect you want."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.48,
      "end": 7.88,
      "text": "If you've ever built an app, you know this feeling:"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.88,
      "end": 10.92,
      "text": "you can picture the animation, but you can't describe it."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.92,
      "end": 13.59,
      "text": "All you can say is \"make it feel premium.\""
    },
    {
      "start": 13.59,
      "end": 16.42,
      "text": "Your designer doesn't get it. Neither does AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.42,
      "end": 17.5,
      "text": "And even worse,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.5,
      "end": 19.93,
      "text": "you don't know what native iOS can actually do."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.93,
      "end": 21.4,
      "text": "So I built Motionary,"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.4,
      "end": 24.07,
      "text": "a hands-on dictionary of iOS motion."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.07,
      "end": 27.11,
      "text": "461 effects across 15 categories,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.11,
      "end": 29.33,
      "text": "organized into 85 families."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.33,
      "end": 32.37,
      "text": "Search any keyword and find it in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.37,
      "end": 35.8,
      "text": "Tap Signature Interactions for the most polished ones."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.8,
      "end": 40.03,
      "text": "Every effect is real SwiftUI, running live, not a video."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.03,
      "end": 42.06,
      "text": "Press them, drag them,"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.06,
      "end": 44.47,
      "text": "and feel the Taptic Engine haptics."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.47,
      "end": 46.5,
      "text": "You'll know right away if it feels right."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.5,
      "end": 48.74,
      "text": "My favorite is this Day / Night Toggle."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.74,
      "end": 50.77,
      "text": "Look how smooth that transition is."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.77,
      "end": 52.4,
      "text": "And this Gear Checklist."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.4,
      "end": 55.24,
      "text": "Packing everything feels so satisfying."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.24,
      "end": 58.84,
      "text": "Each one comes with a pro prompt in English and Chinese,"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.84,
      "end": 62.26,
      "text": "spelling out the duration, curve and spring values."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.26,
      "end": 65.47,
      "text": "Hand it to your AI or designer, and they can rebuild it."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.47,
      "end": 68.71,
      "text": "Want a quick look? Browse every recording on the web."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.71,
      "end": 71.15,
      "text": "Want to feel it? Try it yourself in the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.15,
      "end": 74.18,
      "text": "The whole project is open source. Go check it out."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.18,
